# Operational backups the server makes for itself. These are never code, they
# live only on the box, and leaving them untracked made `git status` unreadable
# — which is how a real modified file (package-lock.json) sat unnoticed among
# eight lines of noise.
*.bak
data.bak-*/
/FETCH_HEAD

# fonts:check writes a sample render here — a diagnostic, not an asset
bot/fonts-check.png
